# Upstream catalog clone, ~733MB. Only needed to regenerate web/data:
#   git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/ChristopherLloyd/LooPindex.git reference/LooPindex
#   python3 tools/extract_levels.py
reference/

# web/data/ is generated, but is committed on purpose: rebuilding it needs the
# 733MB clone above, so ignoring it would leave a fresh checkout unable to run
# the game at all.

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
